@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Systemstatus
GET {{baseUrl}}/status

### Inselkarte
GET {{baseUrl}}/map

### Drohne registrieren
POST {{baseUrl}}/unit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "drone-1",
  "type": "drone",
  "role": "drone",
  "status": "IDLE",
  "rpcHost": "drone-1",
  "rpcPort": 50052,
  "capabilities": ["aerial_inspection", "search_person", "water_crossing"]
}

### Reparatur-Rover registrieren
POST {{baseUrl}}/unit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "repair-rover-1",
  "type": "repair_rover",
  "role": "repair_rover",
  "status": "IDLE",
  "rpcHost": "repair-rover-1",
  "rpcPort": 50053,
  "capabilities": ["repair_route", "repair_structure"]
}

### Versorgungs-Rover registrieren
POST {{baseUrl}}/unit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "supply-rover-1",
  "type": "supply_rover",
  "role": "supply_rover",
  "status": "IDLE",
  "rpcHost": "supply-rover-1",
  "rpcPort": 50054,
  "capabilities": ["deliver_supplies", "restock_material"]
}

### Vorhandenes Fahrzeug aktualisieren (Upsert)
POST {{baseUrl}}/unit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "drone-1",
  "type": "drone",
  "role": "drone",
  "status": "IDLE",
  "rpcHost": "drone-1",
  "rpcPort": 50052,
  "capabilities": ["aerial_inspection", "search_person", "water_crossing"]
}

### Wasserstandssensor registrieren
POST {{baseUrl}}/sensor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "water-sensor-1",
  "type": "water-level"
}

### Kamerasensor registrieren
POST {{baseUrl}}/sensor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "camera-1",
  "type": "camera"
}

### Wasserstandsalarm -> Drohne, Prioritaet 8
POST {{baseUrl}}/incident
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "water_level_alert",
  "sensor": "water-sensor-1",
  "x": 5,
  "y": 7,
  "value": 91
}

### Person erkannt -> Drohne, Prioritaet 10
POST {{baseUrl}}/incident
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "person_detected",
  "sensor": "camera-1",
  "x": 9,
  "y": 3,
  "confidence": 0.94
}

### Schwer erreichbarer Einsatzort -> Drohne, Prioritaet 8
POST {{baseUrl}}/incident
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "terrain_inspection",
  "sensor": "camera-1",
  "x": 2,
  "y": 14,
  "hardToReach": true
}

### Blockierter Weg -> Reparatur-Rover, Prioritaet 7
POST {{baseUrl}}/incident
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "blocked_route",
  "sensor": "camera-1",
  "x": 12,
  "y": 6
}

### Strukturschaden -> Reparatur-Rover, Prioritaet 7
POST {{baseUrl}}/incident
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "structure_damage",
  "sensor": "camera-1",
  "x": 8,
  "y": 11
}

### Brueckenschaden -> Reparatur-Rover, Prioritaet 7
POST {{baseUrl}}/incident
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "bridge_damage",
  "sensor": "camera-1",
  "x": 16,
  "y": 4
}

### Niedriger Bestand -> Versorgungs-Rover, Prioritaet 6
POST {{baseUrl}}/incident
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "supply_low",
  "sensor": "water-sensor-1",
  "x": 4,
  "y": 10,
  "item": "drinking_water",
  "remaining": 12
}

### Materialanforderung -> Versorgungs-Rover, Prioritaet 6
POST {{baseUrl}}/incident
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "material_request",
  "sensor": "camera-1",
  "x": 13,
  "y": 15,
  "item": "repair_material",
  "amount": 5
}

### Unbekannter Incident-Typ -> Incident ohne Mission
POST {{baseUrl}}/incident
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "unknown_incident",
  "sensor": "camera-1",
  "x": 1,
  "y": 1
}

### Incident mit ID manuell loeschen
POST {{baseUrl}}/incident/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "incident-1784124645148-4"
}

### Nicht vorhandener Endpoint -> 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist

### Nicht unterstuetzte HTTP-Methode -> 405 Method Not Allowed
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/unit

### Fehlerhaftes JSON -> 500 Internal Server Error
POST {{baseUrl}}/incident
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "person_detected"
}
